  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Легко управляйте меню вашего ресторана с помощью Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Месяц",
  "/Year": "/Год",
  "Buy Now": "Купить сейчас",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Динамические предложения и акции",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Увеличьте свои продажи и привлеките больше клиентов с помощью нашей функции управления предложениями. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Эффективное расположение столов",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Оптимизируйте свое обеденное пространство и оптимизируйте свою деятельность с помощью нашей функции расстановки столов. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Настройка и обновления в реальном времени",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Настройте свое меню в соответствии с уникальной индивидуальностью вашего ресторана с помощью наших инструментов создания атрибутов и категорий. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Расширенное взаимодействие с клиентами",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Поднимите обслуживание клиентов на новый уровень с помощью наших инструментов управления клиентами. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Обновления интерфейса в реальном времени",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "С помощью Dash SaaS любые изменения, которые вы вносите в свое меню, предложения или расстановку обеденных столов, мгновенно отображаются на интерфейсе. ",
